WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.439
Hello. I have a headache.

00:00:02.689 --> 00:00:03.940
Since when?

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:07.901
Since this morning. I would like to speak to the pharmacist.

00:00:08.151 --> 00:00:11.559
Of course. Please wait here.

00:00:11.809 --> 00:00:15.577
Thank you. I also have a question about my prescription.
